name: Triboulet — king/queen X2
author: corpus
description: >-
  Triboulet gives each played King and Queen X2 Mult when scored. First-shop legendary
  from The Soul: pair with Baron, Mime, and held-in-hand Queen/King builds.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - legendaryJoker: Triboulet
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      arcanaPacks: [0, 1]
      spectralPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Baron
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Mime
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: ShootTheMoon
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
